  "answer_input_mode": "answer.txt only",
  "answer": "According to the Oh My Zsh wiki (https://github.com/ohmyzsh/ohmyzsh/wiki/Themes), to change the zsh theme to agnoster: open your ~/.zshrc file, set ZSH_THEME=\"agnoster\" (before the line that sources Oh My Zsh), save the file, then restart your terminal or run 'source ~/.zshrc' to apply it. Note: the agnoster theme requires a Powerline-compatible font.",
